		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>The spirit of a gruesomely slain woman. Wanders roads and alleys, slaying victims with her long, barbed hair.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 hair (near) +4 (1d6 + bleed) and laugh, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bleed</strong>. 1d4 damage each round. CON 12+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Laugh</strong>. All mortals within near who hear harionago laugh, WIS 15+ or start laughing, prone and helpless for 1d4 rounds. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
